### Uses the "REST Client" VS Code extension — click "Send Request" above any block.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = change-me

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### List partners
GET {{baseUrl}}/partners

### List gallery
GET {{baseUrl}}/gallery

### List membership tiers
GET {{baseUrl}}/membership-tiers

### List stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### Submit a lead (public — no token needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "join",
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "organisation": "",
  "message": "Testing from VS Code"
}

### List leads (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads
x-admin-token: {{token}}

### Add a project (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-token: {{token}}

{
  "tag": "Environment",
  "title": "River Cleanup Drive",
  "description": "Quarterly cleanups along the Motoine River.",
  "status": "Fundraising",
  "goal_kes": 200000,
  "raised_pct": 0,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611273426858-450d8e3c9fce?w=700&h=480&fit=crop&auto=format",
  "image_alt": "Volunteers cleaning a riverbank",
  "sort_order": 4
}

### Update raised_pct on project 1 (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-token: {{token}}

{
  "raised_pct": 70
}

### Delete project 5 (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/5
x-admin-token: {{token}}
